  "adoptedScope": "Always attempt owned reader disposal when completing the root pump, including a throwing completion callback; preserve supplied reader ownership and CloseInput behavior.",
  "intentionalPolicy": "Callback-only and disposal-only faults preserve their original exception. Dual failure produces AggregateException with original callback first and disposal second, retaining both rather than allowing finally to discard the callback.",
  "notAdopted": [
    "No early-abandonment, record callback failure or initial-load cleanup redesign",
    "No new disposal/cancellation interface, scope, layout or W3C error identity",
    "No full consumer lifetime qualification or API freeze",
    "No normative XPath/XSD semantic change"
  ]
